# ====== BEN JACOBS OPEN-NEWS + SEPARATE CONTROL REPORTS PATCH (2026-07-21) ======
# Compatibility contract:
# - No persistent filename, state key, cache key or saved history format changes.
# - Exact post-id/link dedupe stays active.
# - Concrete Ben Jacobs transfer/contract reports are not rejected by relevance,
#   tier, fee, uncertainty or fuzzy-similarity gates.
# - Hard editorial/safety blocks (women, other sports, live, pure interview,
#   podcast, lineup and old posts) remain active.
